n    convention -- and the list was missing it.\\\\n    \\\\n    @pytest.mark.own_records already existed and already had a guard\\\\n    (test_own_records_guard.py) enforcing that every test reading this\\\\n    repository's own records carries it. This closes the gap: the six\\\\n    doctor tests gain the marker, [tests].run and ci.yml's full-suite step\\\\n    become `-m 'not own_records'`, the doctor job and the inherit path run\\\\n    `-m own_records`, every --deselect and DESELECT_FLAGS list is gone, and\\\\n    the guard's exemption for the doctor tests goes with it.\\\\n    \\\\n    Also lands the bucket line: a fix item's spec names the root-cause\\\\n    bucket it closes with `Bucket: <slug>`, and spec-gate refuses a slug\\\\n    attest/buckets.md does not list before any criterion runs. buckets.md\\\\n    lists the five buckets from the 2026-09-27 convergence ruling.\\\\n    \\\\n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\\\\n\\\\ndiff --git a/.github/workflows/ci.yml b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\\\\nindex 70a96ac..a7780b7 100644\\\\n--- a/.github/workflows/ci.yml\\\\n+++ b/.github/workflows/ci.yml\\\\n@@ -51,13 +51,7 @@ jobs:\\\\n       - name: pytest\\\\n         if: steps.inherit.outputs.inherit != 'true'\\\\n         run: >\\\\n-          python3 -m pytest tests -q --durations=5\\\\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_every_gate_rejects\\\\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_one_item_traversed_every_stage\\\\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_commit_lacks_a_record\\\\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_stop_lacks_cause\\\\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_every_attested_item_is_sealed\\\\n-          --deselect tests/test_doctor.py::test_no_attested_item_is_empty\\\\n+          python3 -m pytest tests -q --durations=5 -m 'not own_records'\\\\n       - name: pytest end\\\\n         if: steps.inherit.outputs.inherit != 'true'\\\\n         run: echo \\\\\\\"PYTES